# Ghostdock's own services on the VM (the desktop stream and its display, the
# desktop's activity reporter and guard, the package lists' first fetch):
# gdo-guest reports this slice's CPU with its own, and the host leaves it out
# of the workload's work, which keeps the VM awake (https://docs.ghostdock.ai/vms/sleep). The
# person's programs never run here: the desktop session (gdo-desktop.service)
# is in system.slice like any service of theirs.
[Unit]
Description=Ghostdock's own services
Before=slices.target
